<font class="print-title">Password Theft Protection</font><br />
<font class="print-sub">Date: Friday, May 09 @ 21:33:12<br />
Topic Shadowbane</font>
<br /><br />
</td></tr>
<tr><td>
<font class="print-normal">Please be extremely careful about accepting and opening files by email or by private messages, even from people you know. If you do not have anti-virus software, download some now! Always be watchful of files that are sent to you since they could be very harmful to your system, or be used to steal your personal information, or gain access to your files. <br />
 <br />
There are also many reports about 'dictionary' style hacks that could take your login and try to gain access by spamming numerous potential random passwords at the system. This procedure is often referred to as 'Brute Force'. Ubi Soft has security features implemented with Shadowbane accounts. <br />
 <br />
As a security measure, you should never use an easy password, or one that is connected to you in some way. Use special characters, letters, and numbers. These simple safeguards can improve your overall security dramatically. <br />
 <br />
Lastly, never ever give your account password to anyone. As a reminder, Ubi Soft will never ask a customer for their password under any circumstances. For tips on creating a password, please read our suggestions in the account FAQ.<br />
